    "text": "name: cocosair\ndescription: Route AIR tasks by subsystem or visual symptom; choose direct dependencies and check capabilities.\n\nname: cocosair-2d-subsystems\ndescription: Build DragonBones, TiledMap, 2D/3D particles and billboards from runtime data. Use for raw asset strings, missing pixels, MotionStreak or Spine backend limits.\n\nname: cocosair-agent-session\ndescription: Inspect live scenes and frames with devtools; read runtime diagnostics. Use for scoped session writes, pixel probes or duplicate requestId INVALID_ARGUMENT errors.\n\nname: cocosair-animation-tween\ndescription: Animate tweens and AnimationClip tracks with one step clock. Use to loop a sequence on a target, reverseTime, clean up playback or diagnose unavailable pose graphs.\n\nname: cocosair-application\ndescription: Configure createAirApp options, canvas, lifecycle, screen sizing and context health. Use for WEBGL2_REQUIRED startup errors, scene replacement, session cleanup or lost contexts.\n\nname: cocosair-assets\ndescription: Load asset URL textures, atlases and BMFont with AssetBank. Use for refcounted disposal, extension selection, cache reuse or AIR_E_ATLAS_IN_USE/AIR_E_FNT_IN_USE cleanup.\n\nname: cocosair-audio-video\ndescription: Play media with AudioService, VideoPlayer and WebView. Use for silent autoplay, advancing currentTime, BGM/SFX channels or DOM video and iframe overlays.\n\nname: cocosair-camera\ndescription: Configure Camera projection, viewports, framing and screen/world conversion. Use for split-screen, pointer rays, wrong screenToWorld results or AIR_E_ORTHO_WIDTH.\n\nname: cocosair-gltf\ndescription: Load glTF/GLB models, extensions, decoder injection and instances. Use for Draco/meshopt/KTX2 deployment, GLTF_DECODER_MISSING, uncoded load errors or animation loops.\n\nname: cocosair-graphics-and-dom\ndescription: Draw Graphics/SVG shapes and sprite masks; align a DOM overlay with UI/canvas nodes. Use for overlay placement, input interception, experimental HTML textures or AirUIMesh.\n\nname: cocosair-input-action\ndescription: Wire keyboard, mouse, touch and action state; navigate SceneStack pages. Use for focus, held-key resets, session gates, DOM canvas errors or persistent push/pop.\n\nname: cocosair-materials-effects\ndescription: Configure materials, effects, uniforms, defines and GLSL. Diagnose black/invisible effects, missing textures, setProperty, AIR_E_MATERIAL_NOT_READY or AIR_E_MATERIAL_TYPE.\n\nname: cocosair-math\ndescription: Compute vectors, matrices, quaternions, colors and easing. Use for out-first math, frozen Vec3.UP errors, transform composition, rotation units or Mat4.invert.\n\nname: cocosair-performance\ndescription: Optimize draw calls: static merge, instancing, dynamic atlases and GPU morph fields. Frame budgets, on-demand rendering, AIR_E_MESH_CAPACITY, AIR_E_PIXEL_RATIO_IMPORT_ORDER.\n\nname: cocosair-physics\ndescription: Choose builtin, cannon or Box2D physics; wire rigid bodies, colliders and raycasts. Use for missing gravity, trigger filters, backend limits or material error 9642.\n\nname: cocosair-primitives-mesh\ndescription: Build primitive geometry, Mesh buffers and MeshRenderer bindings. Use for vertex attributes, indices, wireframes or AIR_E_PRIMITIVE_DESCRIPTOR validation.\n\nname: cocosair-project-setup\ndescription: Set up npm imports, package entries, importmap, TypeScript and variant builds. Use for cocosair.js installation, unresolved-import errors, page shells or build artifacts.\n\nname: cocosair-rendering\ndescription: Configure lighting, shadows, render targets, MSAA and sRGB. Use for offscreen pixels, post-processing, AIR_E_RENDER_TARGET_SAMPLES or AIR_E_TEXTURE_COLOR.\n\nname: cocosair-scene-graph\ndescription: Build Scene/Node hierarchies, Component lifecycles, layers and events. Use for reparenting, active inheritance, NodePool reuse, scene globals or resource release.\n\nname: cocosair-skinning-morph\ndescription: Bind skeletons, restore bind poses and drive morph weights. Use for realtime/baked deformation, AIR_E_SKINNING_JOINT_PATH or AIR_E_SKINNING_CAPACITY.\n\nname: cocosair-ui-2d\ndescription: Build Canvas UI with sprites, Label text, layout and widgets. Use for missing UI, viewport alignment, 2D draw order, BMFont binding or AIR_E_LABEL_WRAP.\n\nname: cocosair-verification\ndescription: Choose verification gates and assess browser/package evidence, write behavior and fingerprints. Use to validate changes, distinguish FAIL/UNSUPPORTED or check release readiness.\n",
